GoogleBook OS source collection — license index

There is no single license for every file in this repository.

Original port documentation and port material identified as MIT in
manifests/license-audit.json are covered by the unchanged project MIT grant in LICENSES/MIT-Project.txt.
Third-party source and patches retain their own per-file grants, including
GPL-2.0-only, GPL-2.0-or-later, LGPL package terms, Apache-2.0, MIT,
BSD-3-Clause, HPND-sell-variant, and the recorded dual-license alternatives.

Consult LICENSING.md, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, the source headers, component
COPYING/NOTICE files, and manifests/license-audit.json. LICENSES/ contains
license and exception texts; notices/ preserves component-specific notices.

This index does not relicense third-party material, remove an alternative
grant, impose a new restriction, or certify a future binary/image release.
